{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "1818",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "You're here for a mission?  Good.  I have an important one, and one that will test your skill in combat... and your resolve in the defense of the Forsaken."
    },
    {
      "id": "1819",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Your task is yet undone, <name>.  It is not wise for a <class> to show fear..."
    },
    {
      "id": "1819",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Well done, <name>.  Ulag was no minor agent of the Scourge.  You have shown the Deathguards, and hence the Dark Lady, that you are a <class> of skill and resolve, and are worthy of further instruction."
    },
    {
      "id": "1820",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Yes, it is true.  I have need for your skills in combat.  My means are small, but my task aids both me and the Forsaken's cause.  Do it, and your reward will be twofold."
    },
    {
      "id": "1821",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Ah!  You retrieved them!  Now the last semblance of honor and memory is stripped from the cursed Agamand lands.  The family truly is no more!"
    },
    {
      "id": "1881",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Greetings, <name>.  You were wise to answer my call, and wiser still if you heed what I next say..."
    },
    {
      "id": "1882",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Do you have the snapdragons?  That breed of flower is highly receptive to magic energies, and studying the snapdragons so close to the Plaguelands can tell us if the plague has entered Tirisfal Glades."
    },
    {
      "id": "1882",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Ah, a fine specimen this is.  I will send it to be studied by our apothecaries to determine the extent of the Plagueland's taint.\n\nWell done, <name>.  For your services, I present to you this choice: an orb or staff.  Whichever you choose, you will find it quite useful."
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "What's this? Gloom weed?! I've no need for Gloom weed! That mindless mass of flesh is out there picking daisies and convincing the Lady knows how many dupes like you into doing the same. No offense.\n\nVery well, you're here now and that's all that matters. Since I'm not going to bother to try to explain things to that abomination how about you collect what I really need... doom weed!"
    },
    {
      "id": "5482",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Ah, my doom weed. Excellent!\n\n<Junior Apothecary Holland rubs his hands together greedily.>\n\nThese will come in quite handy. You've done me, uh, the Lady, a fine service today, <name>. As promised here is the reward that you deserve."
    },
    {
      "id": "86784",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Welcome to my fire, traveler."
    },
    {
      "id": "86784",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Extra firewood? That is always welcome. It will keep these old bones warm through the cold nights of the Glades.\n\nI have a sling for collecting wood myself, so you might as well hang onto that basket."
    },
    {
      "id": "91282",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Another fresh recruit? Welcome to Tyr's Watch, brother."
    },
    {
      "id": "91285",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "These murlocs just don't quit!"
    },
    {
      "id": "91285",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "We appreciate the assistance. I'm sure this won't stop the attacks entirely, but it'll hopefully slow them down a bit. It's hard enough rebuilding this place without a murloc trying to stab you in the back with a spear."
    },
    {
      "id": "91294",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Welcome to Bandarion Keep, <class>. It's always good to see a new face."
    },
    {
      "id": "91294",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Breton sent you up here, eh? Excellent.\n\nMy name is Danitha Morr, and I am the closest thing this keep has to a commander. If you come seeking fellowship amongst those that still remain loyal to the light, you've come to the right place.\n\nThere's a lot of work to do here before we can fully establish ourselves, and we'd be most appreciative if you would be willing to lend aid."
    },
    {
      "id": "91316",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "They say location is everything. While this fortress may look imposing perched upon these bluffs, its turning out to be quite the challenge to stay supplied this far from proper civilization. An unfortunate oversight on our part."
    },
    {
      "id": "91316",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "I'm glad to see that your trip to Shadowvale bore fruit. I'll send Breton and a few of the other new recruits over later to clear the rest of the cellar out and retrieve anything left down in the dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "91317",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "The Tarnished threaten what little goodwill we have with the other Forsaken. As much as it pains me to cross blades with our former brothers and sisters, they must be stopped if our fledgling order is to survive."
    },
    {
      "id": "91317",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Excellent work, <name>. Every time one of these Tarnished strike out and kill one of the Forsaken, it becomes that much easier for our detractors to stoke mistrust towards us paladins. Eliminating them will help further our cause and solidify our place here in Tirisfal.\n\nI suspect it may take a long time for us to be fully embraced by the Forsaken and the horde. It could take years... or maybe even decades, but the best we can do is keep trying to prove ourselves."
    },
    {
      "id": "94427",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "You... you are a <class>? Please, do not hurt me. I-I know I'm not supposed to be panhandling. I have no quarrel with you or your order. Leave me be, I beg you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "94434",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "I hope that this is no imposition upon you, goodly <class>."
    },
    {
      "id": "94434",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "This is very kind of you, <class>. Very kind indeed."
    }
  ],
  "response": {
